/ herb:slots client
/ herb:state (panel: false, height: "0.45", alert: "")
.min-h-full.bg-white
  .mx-auto.max-w-4xl.px-4.py-6
    header.mb-6.flex.items-baseline.justify-between
      h1.text-2xl.font-bold Drawer
      p.hidden.text-sm.text-gray-500.sm:block the sheet follows your finger, the state stays in the template
    p.mb-4.text-sm.text-gray-500
      ' Drag the sheet up to grow it through three heights, and down to shrink it. Past the smallest it dismisses, and a
        quick flick skips straight there. The template only ever sees
      code.rounded.bg-gray-100.px-1> panel
      ' and
      code.rounded.bg-gray-100.px-1 height
      | , both plain state, so the number in the sheet header is
        rendered from the same value the drag writes.
    button type="button" data-herb-set="panel=true" class="rounded bg-lime-500 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-lime-600"
      | Open the queue
    .mt-6.grid.grid-cols-2.gap-4.sm:grid-cols-4
      - Music.albums.first(4).each do |album|
        div herb-key="#{album[:id]}" class="group text-left" = render "shared/album_card", album: album
div(data-moly-drawer-overlay data-moly-drawer-open="#{panel}" data-herb-set="panel=false")
aside data-moly-drawer="bottom" data-moly-drawer-state="panel" data-moly-drawer-snap="0.45, 0.68, 0.92" data-moly-drawer-snap-state="height" data-moly-drawer-open="#{panel}" style="--moly-drawer-size: 92svh"
  div(data-moly-drawer-handle)
  header.flex-none.cursor-grab.px-5.pb-3
    .flex.items-baseline.justify-between
      h2.text-lg.font-bold Up next
      span.ml-auto.mr-2.text-xs.tabular-nums.text-gray-400> = height
      button(type="button" data-moly-drawer-no-drag data-herb-set="panel=false" class="rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 text-sm hover:border-lime-500")
        | Close
    p.mt-1.text-xs.text-gray-500 Scroll the list at any height, and drag the handle or this header to resize.
  .overflow-y-auto.overscroll-contain.px-5.pb-8
    ul.space-y-3.text-sm
      - Music.albums.first(6).each do |album|
        - Music.tracks(album[:id]).each do |track|
          li herb-key="#{album[:id]}:#{track[:number]}" class="flex items-center gap-3"
            = image_tag Music.cover_url(album[:id]), alt: "", class: "h-10 w-10 rounded object-cover shadow"
            .min-w-0
              p.truncate.font-semibold = track[:title]
              p.truncate.text-xs.text-gray-500 #{album[:artist]} &middot; #{album[:title]}
            span.ml-auto.text-xs.tabular-nums.text-gray-400 = track[:duration]
- if alert.present?
  .fixed.inset-0.z-50.flex.items-center.justify-center.bg-emerald-600.text-white data-herb-set=="keydown.escape@window->alert=''"
    .text-center
      p.text-2xl = alert
      button type="button" data-herb-set=="alert=''" class="mt-4 text-sm underline" Dismiss
